hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1393","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas us raat jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko meraj karai gai, sharab aur doodh ke do pyaley laey gaey, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un donon ki taraf dekha phir doodh le liya, to Jibraeel (Alehis salaam) ne kaha: Tamam tareefein Allah ke liye hain jis ne Aap ko fitrat ki hidayat di, agar Aap sharab letey to Aap ki ummat gumrah ho jati. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1394","Unhin se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har wo ahem kaam jo Alhamdolillah se shuru na kya jaey wo naqis (be-barkat) hota hai. Hasan hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud waghera ne riwayat kya hai."
"1395","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab bandey ka beta faut ho jata hai to Allah Taala apne farishton se farmata hai: Kya tum ne mere bandey ke betey ki rooh qabz kar li? Wo kehtey hain: Haan. Phir farmata hai: Kya tum ne uske dil ke phal ko qabz kar liya? Wo kehtey hain: Haan. Phir farmata hai: To mere bandey ne kya kaha? Wo kehtey hain: Us ne Teri hamd bayan ki aur inna lillahi wa inna ilehi rajioon padha. To Allah Taala farmata hai: Mere bandey ke liye Jannat mein aik ghar banao aur us ka naam Baitul Hamd rakho. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1396","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah bandey se raazi hota hai jo aik luqma khata hai to us par Allah ki hamd karta hai, aur aik ghoont peeta hai to us par Allah ki hamd karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
